 ],
 "synopsis": "Royal Chain, a Mumbai-based B2B jewellery manufacturer, has filed a draft red herring prospectus with SEBI to raise Rs 1,000 crore through an initial public offering. The public offering comprises a fresh issue of equity shares worth Rs 850 crore and an offer for sale worth up to Rs 150 crore by its promoters. The company intends to use Rs 650 crore of the fresh issue proceeds to repay debt, alongside funding general corporate purposes. JM Financial and 360 ONE WAM are the merchant bankers managing the issue.",
